Here's an R function that checks if all non-NA elements in a character vector can be converted to numeric:

```R
is_all_numeric <- function(x) {
  x <- as.character(x) # Ensure x is a character vector

  # Check if any element is NA
  if (any(is.na(x))) {
    return(FALSE)
  }

  # Try converting all elements to numeric
  tryCatch({
    x <- as.numeric(x)
  }, error = function(e) {
    return(FALSE)
  })

  # All elements were successfully converted to numeric
  return(TRUE)
}
```

You can use this function like this:

```R
