x <- c("1", "2", "3", "4", "5")
y <- c("6", "7", "8", "9", NA)
z <- c("A", "B", "C", "D", "E")

print(is_all_numeric(x)) # Output: TRUE
print(is_all_numeric(y)) # Output: FALSE
print(is_all_numeric(z)) # Output: FALSE
```

Here's the R code to check if all non-NA elements in a character vector can be converted to numeric:

```R
